  "text": "It says the laws of physics stop time machines from ever being built.",
  "dur": 6.59,
  "transition_in": "tilt",
  "prev": "Hawking thought it does. In 1992, he proposed what he called the Chronology Protection Conjecture.",
  "nxt": "In his words, there seems to be a chronology protection agency that makes the universe safe for historians.",
  "frog_hint": false
 },
